"{\"url\":\"https://www.microcision.com/sales-manager\",\"title\":\"SALES - BUSINESS DEVELPMENT MANAGER | Microcision\",\"desc\":null,\"og\":null,\"robots\":null,\"imgs\":[\"Microcision logo.png | 31e942_ef154a865afe4fa79723417987ebbaeb~mv2.png\"],\"form\":[],\"iframes\":[],\"sha256\":\"886d89e7746380e0910a2358e1f19008a8c553780f206d2c64baa7fd5746f1f4\",\"text\":\"Skip to Main Content\\n\\nHOME\\n\\nSERVICES\\n\\nABOUT\\n\\nEXPANSION\\n\\nCAREERS\\n\\nCONTACT\\n\\nSALES - BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT MANAGER\\n\\nMicrocision, a premier medical device manufacturer located in Pennsauken, NJ \\u2013 is recruiting a seasoned sales professional. The company is a leader in producing medical device implants and instruments for worldwide OEMs.\\n\\nThe position will be responsible for developing new business and projects by working with design engineers and purchasing professionals. Primary duties and responsibilities include:\\n\\n\\u200b\\n\\n\\u00b7 Represent the company to leading Medical Device OEMs. Accounts are located throughout the US and Europe.\\n\\n\\u00b7 This position will focus on developing business in new and existing accounts. The medical device market is technology driven and ever evolving in design and use.\\n\\n\\u00b7 The Business Development Manager will work directly with Microcision\\u2019s President, senior manufacturing staff and current sales manager to continuously develop marketing and sales plans, penetrate new and existing markets and drive on-line and trade show campaigns.\\n\\n\\u200b\\n\\nPreferred candidates would be able to meet the following requirements:\\n\\n\\u200b\\n\\n\\u00b7 3-5 years minimum experience selling into an OEM structure or,\\n\\n\\u00b7 Equivalent experience selling engineered products to a Supplier network or,\\n\\n\\u00b7 A sales engineering background.\\n\\n\\u200b\\n\\n\\u00a0\\n\\nMicrocision has a long history of success developing and manufacturing medical device implants and instrumentation. The company is located just outside Philadelphia in a thoroughly modern/purposed, 45,000+ sq ft facility. With additional capacity and capabilities in state-of-the-art manufacturing, assembly and packaging, Microcision is rapidly expanding its customer base. Come join our incredibly dynamic 80+ person team.\\n\\n\\u200b\\n\\nThe company offers a very competitive salary, profit-sharing, health care benefits and 401k\\n\\n\\u00a9 2022\\u00a0by Microcision LLC\"}"
